// Component: infra/proxy/launch.py and infra/proxy/assemble.py (with
// infra/proxy/__init__.py) -- the host's end of the egress proxy
// (decision-0009 item 2). assemble.py builds the proxy's one file from the
// decision's source, which it is handed as text (infra imports no domain),
// and program.py's; launch.py starts that file from its stdin and ends it.
// program.py itself is the egress proxy container, never here.
model {
  extend brig.library {
    proxyLink = component 'Proxy Link' {
      technology 'Python 3.15, stdlib only'
      description 'The host\'s end of a jail\'s egress proxy: assembles the proxy file from the egress decision\'s source, the log envelope\'s and program.py behind the supervisor\'s version guard, starts it as this process\'s child with its program on stdin, a fixed environment, its grants as one JSON line on a pipe held for the jail\'s life, then each change to them as one more, and its end of the supervisor\'s socketpair; drains its decision lines into a bounded buffer the embedder takes them from; and ends it by closing that pipe, killing its group and reaping it. Plain data in and out.'
    }
  }
}
